{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":9,"exerciseID":"03rKkI1HL1PoQl3OkD5","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":7,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"七年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)①35°②55°(2)存在，52.5°或7.5°","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed76779a47b5ff80031812e","queId":"03rKkI1HL1PoQl3OkD5","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee5"}],"question":"如图，已知直线AB∥射线CD，∠CEB＝110°．P是射线EB上一动点，过点P作PQ∥EC交射线CD于点Q，连接CP．作∠PCF＝∠PCQ，交直线AB于点F，CG平分∠ECF．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f4071198c007x.png\">","solution":"(1)①∵AB∥CD，∠CEB+∠ECQ＝180°，∵∠CEB＝110°，∴∠ECQ＝70°，∵∠PCF＝∠PCQ，CG平分∠ECF，∴<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f40725eee0086.png\">；②∵AB∥CD，∴∠QCG＝∠EGC，∵∠QCG+∠ECG＝∠ECQ＝70°，∴∠EGC+∠ECG＝70°，又∵∠EGC﹣∠ECG＝30°，∴∠EGC＝50°，∠ECG＝20°，∴∠ECG＝∠GCF＝20°，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f40725ef5007t.png\">，∵PQ∥CE，∴∠CPQ＝∠ECP＝∠ECQ﹣∠PCQ＝70°﹣15°＝55°．(2)52.5°或7.5°，设∠EGC＝3x°，∠EFC＝2x°，①当点G、F在点E的右侧时，∵AB∥CD，∴∠QCG＝∠EGC＝3x°，∠QCF＝∠EFC＝2x°，则∠GCF＝∠QCG﹣∠QCF＝3x°﹣2x°＝x°，∴<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f40725efe0080.png\">，则∠ECG＝∠GCF＝∠PCF＝∠PCD＝x°，∵∠ECD＝70°，∴4x＝70°，解得x＝17.5°，∴∠CPQ＝3x＝52.5°；②当点G、F在点E的左侧时，反向延长CD到H，∵∠EGC＝3x°，∠EFC＝2x°，∴∠GCH＝∠EGC＝3x°，∠FCH＝∠EFC＝2x°，∴∠ECG＝∠GCF＝∠GCH﹣∠FCH＝x°，∵∠CGF＝180°﹣3x°，∠GCQ＝70°+x°，∴180﹣3x＝70+x，解得x＝27.5，∴∠FCQ＝∠ECF+∠ECQ＝27.5°×2+70°＝125°，∴<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f40725f030087.png\">，∴∠CPQ＝∠ECP＝62.5°﹣55°＝7.5°，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17f40725f1f007u.png\">","subQueNum":2,"subQues":[{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"tDxafre9Mydl4eVukE8","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"03rKkI1HL1PoQl3OkD5","question":"若点P，F，G都在点E的右侧．①求∠PCG的度数；②若∠EGC﹣∠ECG＝30°，求∠CPQ的度数．（不能使用“三角形的内角和是180°”直接解题）","sortIndex":1},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"7tgrzO93rW2N9ZqjS3g","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"03rKkI1HL1PoQl3OkD5","question":"在点P的运动过程中，是否存在这样的情形，使∠EGC：∠EFC＝3：2？若存在，直接写